# Window scan (test L9 of codebase/DESIGN_REVIEW.md 8.1; second G2 criterion of Track E),
# package tracks/E-stoch-inf/window.  One Slurm job on one card:
#   harness/bin/nrpic-run submit --package tracks/E-stoch-inf/window --kind scouting --gate G2
#     --launcher batch --exe /data/haiyangw/nrpic/scratch/core/exe/core_scalar-2/athena_gpu
#     --list tracks/E-stoch-inf/window/inputs/card_window.list --gpu-hours 0.5 --wall 00:30:00
# W = (1 + tanh[s ln(sigma a H/k)])/2, <scalar_field> noise_sharpness = s, noise_sigma = sigma
# (coord/INTERFACES/scalar_field.md 7.3); the box stays 2 pi (sigma = 1 box of P1:509-512).
# USR (inflection) case at 128^3, nmax2 = 1024 (k_max = N/4 = 32 dk, P1's ratio), mode file of
# the usr package, same tlim (N* + 10) and dump_dt (0.5) for every run; noise_mode_scale = +-1
# gives the odd (first + third order) and even (second order) parts of each window.
# Cost from the ladder's Q128p (SR, 128^3, nmax2 = 1024, 693 steps in 112 s on one A100,
# job 4470, run E-20261115-172625-416fec0): USR 852 steps, about 2.4 min per run with 22
# dumps of 285 MB; SR 64^3 a few seconds.  10 USR + 6 SR runs: about 25 min (0.42 card-hours).
# Order: the six runs the package needs first, then the slow-roll contrast, then the mirrored
# runs of the other four windows (cut first if the wall limit is reached).
b_p    tracks/E-stoch-inf/window/inputs/usr_256.athinput mesh/nx1=128 mesh/nx2=128 mesh/nx3=128 meshblock/nx1=128 meshblock/nx2=128 meshblock/nx3=128 scalar_field/noise_nmax2=1024 scalar_field/noise_mode_file=/data/haiyangw/nrpic/wt/E-stoch-inf/tracks/E-stoch-inf/usr/inputs/modes_usr_n1024.txt scalar_field/noise_sharpness=5.0 scalar_field/noise_sigma=1.0 scalar_field/noise_mode_scale=1.0
b_m    tracks/E-stoch-inf/window/inputs/usr_256.athinput mesh/nx1=128 mesh/nx2=128 mesh/nx3=128 meshblock/nx1=128 meshblock/nx2=128 meshblock/nx3=128 scalar_field/noise_nmax2=1024 scalar_field/noise_mode_file=/data/haiyangw/nrpic/wt/E-stoch-inf/tracks/E-stoch-inf/usr/inputs/modes_usr_n1024.txt scalar_field/noise_sharpness=5.0 scalar_field/noise_sigma=1.0 scalar_field/noise_mode_scale=-1.0
s25_p  tracks/E-stoch-inf/window/inputs/usr_256.athinput mesh/nx1=128 mesh/nx2=128 mesh/nx3=128 meshblock/nx1=128 meshblock/nx2=128 meshblock/nx3=128 scalar_field/noise_nmax2=1024 scalar_field/noise_mode_file=/data/haiyangw/nrpic/wt/E-stoch-inf/tracks/E-stoch-inf/usr/inputs/modes_usr_n1024.txt scalar_field/noise_sharpness=2.5 scalar_field/noise_sigma=1.0 scalar_field/noise_mode_scale=1.0
